# The design history (the spec, the plan, every task brief) is kept in the repo for provenance, and it
# names the account this was built against. `export-ignore` keeps it out of `git archive`, which is what
# GitHub's release tarball and "Download ZIP" are built from. The repo-hygiene test allowlists the same
# two paths, so nothing else may carry account-specific values. See tests/test_repo_hygiene.py.
docs/superpowers export-ignore
.superpowers export-ignore
